# Settings > Updates > Launcher > What's new (report 047 P1, D9 / D10): three versions behind (0.8.10 running, 0.8.11,
# 0.8.12 and 0.8.13 released): the notes of every skipped version, newest first, each under its version heading, as
# plain text (no Markdown markers, comments or Install part), bullets with a hanging indent; then Down presses and the
# end of the text (the footer "0.8.10 is installed."). Review only: no golden.
title updates whats new three versions
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-05
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.10 release arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_three_root
expect_text "0.8.13 available"
key ENTER
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_whatsnew_three
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 500
shot updates_whatsnew_three_scrolled
key END
wait 500
shot updates_whatsnew_three_end
